{
  "name": "Track weekly brand visibility in ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google AI with Apify and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "deec3b9f-cb1e-4a27-afba-a83a7721ec0d",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -760,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Track your brand's AI visibility every week\n\n**For:** marketers, SEO/GEO agencies and founders who want to know whether ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Claude and Google's AI answers recommend their brand or their competitors.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every Monday at 8:00 (or when you click **Execute workflow**) it sends your buyer questions to the AI engines you pick, through the [AI Visibility Tracker](https://apify.com/touchrock/ai-share-of-voice) Actor on Apify.\n2. It checks every 2 minutes until the run ends. Small runs take a few minutes; many prompts and engines can take about 20.\n3. It reads the run summary and appends one row per brand and engine to Google Sheets: mention rate, share of voice, average list rank and citation rate.\n\n### Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Create an Apify account and copy your API token from [API & Integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Create one **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`. Use it in **Start AI visibility check**, **Check run status** and **Get report**.\n3. Edit **Your brand and prompts**: your brand, domain, competitors, the questions your buyers ask, engines, country and language.\n4. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named `AI visibility` and these headers in row 1: `date, engine, brand, yourBrand, answers, mentionedIn, mentionRatePct, shareOfVoicePct, avgListRank, citationRatePct, runUrl`. Connect **Append to Google Sheets** and pick the sheet.\n5. Click **Execute workflow** once to test, then activate the workflow.\n\n### Cost\nThe Actor charges per AI answer checked (see its Apify page); failed checks are free. **Start AI visibility check** caps each run at 5 USD (`maxTotalChargeUsd`). On Apify's free plan the Actor checks up to 10 prompts per run.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fc53f17c-9c56-4f33-8c8c-42660bf3f6e8",
      "name": "Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 1. When and what to check\nRuns weekly or by hand. Edit the JSON in **Your brand and prompts**. Engines: `chatgpt`, `gemini`, `perplexity`, `claude`, `google_ai_overview`, `google_ai_mode`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fd6a5d1b-6544-454b-b2d9-aa390f62fbfa",
      "name": "Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        340,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 900,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 2. Run the Actor and wait\nStarts the run, then checks its status every 2 minutes. A run that fails or times out stops the workflow with a link to the run."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0c8f91c5-9bbf-489b-84db-abab1decce2f",
      "name": "Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1280,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 3. Save the results\nTurns the run summary into one row per brand and engine (`all` = every engine together) and appends them to Google Sheets."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "feb285df-d8b4-4c25-a733-68478829e236",
      "name": "Every Monday at 8:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
